WEBVTT

00:08.670 --> 00:15.310
<b>Picking up the yesterday that
someone threw away</b>

00:15.310 --> 00:18.610
<b>I just reached my hand out
like a daredevil</b>

00:18.610 --> 00:21.920
<b>Thrusting the answer out</b>

00:21.920 --> 00:27.380
<b>No matter what I get, I won't
ever be satisfied</b>

00:28.560 --> 00:34.500
<b>Escape from the gaps in
your tangled up heart</b>

00:34.500 --> 00:36.570
<b>That's right, make a treasure</b>

00:36.570 --> 00:41.800
<b>I hear your voice in the rusted time</b>

00:41.800 --> 00:44.840
<b>I want to deliver it just as it is</b>

00:44.840 --> 00:48.110
<b>You are waiting in the light</b>

00:48.110 --> 00:51.750
<b>That's what I believe</b>

00:51.750 --> 00:55.340
<b>Right away</b>

01:05.930 --> 01:07.960
<b>So, make a treasure</b>

01:07.960 --> 01:13.200
<b>I search for myself in the rusted mirror</b>

01:13.200 --> 01:16.300
<b>I want to seize it with my own hands</b>

01:16.300 --> 01:19.540
<b>You are waiting, no matter where I am</b>

01:19.540 --> 01:23.110
<b>That's what I believe</b>

01:23.110 --> 01:25.770
<b>Right away</b>

01:33.720 --> 01:35.190
<b>I'm tired.</b>

01:37.060 --> 01:40.860
<b>When did this guy turn into a turtle?</b>

01:40.860 --> 01:44.870
<b>I'm sorry, but it's the best he can do.</b>

01:44.870 --> 01:47.270
<b>Can't you go any faster?</b>

01:47.270 --> 01:49.360
<b>I'm so bored I think I'm going to die.</b>

01:50.670 --> 01:54.700
<b>If we went any faster, we might really
end up in the world beyond.</b>

01:55.880 --> 01:58.880
<b>I'm starving, Sanzo!</b>

01:58.880 --> 01:59.850
<b>Shut up.</b>

01:59.850 --> 02:02.750
<b>My stomach and back are gonna
meet up with each other</b>

02:02.750 --> 02:04.280
<b>before we get to the next village!</b>

02:06.120 --> 02:10.080
<b>Should I open a bypass from your
stomach to your back right now?</b>

02:14.760 --> 02:16.230
<b>Oh, but...</b>

02:18.070 --> 02:22.140
<b>If you're hungry, go eat the grass
on the roadside or something.</b>

02:22.140 --> 02:23.740
<b>What?! Where, where?!</b>

02:23.740 --> 02:25.470
<b>Is there any edible-looking
grass around?!</b>

02:46.960 --> 02:49.290
<b>Merciful Goddess! Merciful Goddess!</b>

02:49.970 --> 02:53.100
<b>Souto... Souto has taken
his subordinates and...</b>

02:53.100 --> 02:54.570
<b>I know.</b>

02:55.400 --> 03:00.340
<b>It just means Homura wasn't the only
one disgusted with the Heavens.</b>

03:00.340 --> 03:01.840
<b>Why are you so laid back?!</b>

03:01.840 --> 03:03.610
<b>If you knew all that, would it
not be more logical</b>

03:03.610 --> 03:06.550
<b>to try and convince him to return
to the Heavens?!</b>

03:06.550 --> 03:10.480
<b>Talking to him when he's already
wound up is a waste of time.</b>

03:12.690 --> 03:17.420
<b>Besides, they've already
linked up with Homura.</b>

03:18.790 --> 03:20.860
<b>Souto's squad is a collection
of skilled soldiers</b>

03:20.860 --> 03:24.000
<b>who annihilated a force
ten times their size</b>

03:24.000 --> 03:26.230
<b>in the army's last sham battle!</b>

03:26.870 --> 03:29.360
<b>They'll be troublesome if they
become our enemy!</b>

03:30.270 --> 03:32.240
<b>But even such a talented group</b>

03:32.240 --> 03:35.540
<b>is nothing but common
soldiers in the army.</b>

03:36.850 --> 03:40.480
<b>Because they're under the direct
command of an incompetent general.</b>

03:40.480 --> 03:42.580
<b>Merciful Goddess!</b>

03:44.190 --> 03:47.640
<b>Anyone would grow discontent
if they weren't fairly valued.</b>

03:48.190 --> 03:52.490
<b>More and more may run off to
serve Homura from now on.</b>

03:52.490 --> 03:54.060
<b>Merciful Goddess!</b>

03:54.060 --> 03:58.160
<b>But still, I didn't think you
were such a fool.</b>

04:09.010 --> 04:10.810
<b>Souto's squad?</b>

04:13.180 --> 04:14.840
<b>I've heard the stories.</b>

04:15.380 --> 04:20.120
<b>We five are confident we can
accomplish any mission perfectly!</b>

04:20.120 --> 04:21.950
<b>Please allow us to join your service!</b>

04:24.830 --> 04:25.830
<b>Please!</b>

04:25.830 --> 04:27.290
<b>Please!</b>

04:28.230 --> 04:29.700
<b>Homura...</b>

04:30.970 --> 04:33.830
<b>Do you know about Sanzo
and his company?</b>

04:35.240 --> 04:35.900
<b>Yes!</b>

04:35.900 --> 04:39.470
<b>Liquidate them and bring
the Maten Scripture back.</b>

04:40.980 --> 04:42.940
<b>If you do that, I'll give it
some thought.</b>

04:43.910 --> 04:45.650
<b>Yes, Sir!</b>

04:45.650 --> 04:48.140
<b>We won't fail to meet
your expectations!</b>

04:54.290 --> 04:57.490
<b>How is the situation, Outo?</b>

05:08.040 --> 05:10.610
<b>Commander, I have visual on clothing.</b>

05:10.610 --> 05:12.740
<b>They appear to be those
of Goku and Gojyo.</b>

05:12.740 --> 05:14.210
<b>I see.</b>

05:15.310 --> 05:19.050
<b>We don't know if they've all been
crushed by the boulders.</b>

05:19.050 --> 05:21.050
<b>Even if they escaped,</b>

05:21.050 --> 05:24.690
<b>they have no means of eluding
the traps we set for them.</b>

05:24.690 --> 05:30.220
<b>I feel sorry for them, but they'll die
for our glorious future!</b>

05:35.130 --> 05:37.600
<b>Commander, I've found footprints.</b>

05:37.600 --> 05:39.260
<b>Two have escaped.</b>

05:39.970 --> 05:40.940
<b>Jikoku!</b>

05:40.940 --> 05:42.740
<b>Yo!</b>

05:42.740 --> 05:43.770
<b>Ryokusho!</b>

05:43.770 --> 05:45.310
<b>Yeah!</b>

05:45.310 --> 05:46.410
<b>Sekieki!</b>

05:46.410 --> 05:47.210
<b>Sir!
Sekieki!</b>

05:47.210 --> 05:47.910
<b>Sir!
Go!</b>

05:47.910 --> 05:48.670
<b>Go!</b>

05:53.750 --> 05:56.680
<b>The rockslide was a
coincidental accident...</b>

05:59.550 --> 06:01.610
<b>No way, right?</b>

06:02.920 --> 06:04.730
<b>No shit.</b>

06:04.730 --> 06:08.230
<b>You want to just call it the work
of some trap fanatic?</b>

06:08.230 --> 06:10.560
<b>That'd make me feel a lot better, but...</b>

06:11.200 --> 06:13.670
<b>Do you suppose Goku and Gojyo
are all right?</b>

06:14.300 --> 06:17.740
<b>They're not cute enough
to keel over so easily.</b>

06:28.480 --> 06:31.150
<b>35, 36, 37...</b>

06:32.450 --> 06:34.250
<b>They've gotten through the minefield.</b>

06:37.860 --> 06:40.660
<b>Foolish Genjo Sanzo!</b>

06:40.660 --> 06:43.960
<b>He's as good as telling us
his exact location.</b>

06:44.930 --> 06:46.400
<b>It's only a matter of time</b>

06:46.400 --> 06:48.270
<b>before they fall prey to Jikoku
and the others.</b>

06:52.640 --> 06:54.110
<b>Shall I check?</b>

06:54.710 --> 06:58.370
<b>No, that's fine. Seizing the
Maten Scripture comes first.</b>

07:01.120 --> 07:04.650
<b>How long will you be able to run
from Jikoku and the others,</b>

07:04.650 --> 07:06.090
<b>Genjo Sanzo?</b>

07:07.560 --> 07:08.690
<b>Sanzo?</b>

07:08.690 --> 07:10.280
<b>Yeah, I know.</b>

07:11.830 --> 07:16.390
<b>Damn, they defeated every
last one of our traps.</b>

07:18.330 --> 07:21.170
<b>We can't have them dying
so easily either.</b>

07:21.170 --> 07:23.400
<b>Let's at least get some
enjoyment out of this.</b>

07:24.340 --> 07:27.810
<b>Don't forget there's a second part
to our objective.</b>

07:27.810 --> 07:30.310
<b>We must also take the Scripture.</b>

07:30.310 --> 07:32.310
<b>Sekieki!</b>

07:32.310 --> 07:35.320
<b>Be careful. We'll have nothing left</b>

07:35.320 --> 07:37.550
<b>if you end up burning the precious
Maten Scripture.</b>

07:44.290 --> 07:45.460
<b>Here it comes.</b>

07:45.460 --> 07:46.930
<b>That seems to be the case.</b>

07:54.370 --> 07:55.870
<b>Sanzo!</b>

07:55.870 --> 07:57.860
<b>Stop, I'm your opponent.</b>

08:00.840 --> 08:02.310
<b>You mere demons!</b>

08:05.080 --> 08:06.550
<b>A god?!</b>

08:07.180 --> 08:09.410
<b>Those toys won't work against us!</b>

08:11.890 --> 08:14.650
<b>"Us," meaning he's not alone?!</b>

08:27.440 --> 08:32.600
<b>That man had a chakra. Which
means he's a god, right?</b>

08:35.380 --> 08:36.840
<b>Good grief.</b>

08:37.410 --> 08:40.520
<b>Commander, Jikoku's team has made
contact with Sanzo's group.</b>

08:40.520 --> 08:41.980
<b>It appears they've engaged.</b>

08:42.620 --> 08:45.750
<b>So, Jikoku used a smoke screen?</b>

08:46.450 --> 08:50.360
<b>Confuse the enemy, divide them,
and defeat them individually.</b>

08:50.360 --> 08:52.950
<b>Truly according to strategic theories.</b>

08:55.830 --> 08:57.300
<b>Sanzo?</b>

08:57.830 --> 08:59.300
<b>Sanzo?</b>

09:10.480 --> 09:11.950
<b>Too slow!</b>

09:16.650 --> 09:19.480
<b>Fool! You came out here
just to be killed!</b>

09:20.420 --> 09:21.980
<b>Shoot!</b>

09:25.290 --> 09:28.930
<b>Normally, I'd take more loving care
of guys like you,</b>

09:28.930 --> 09:31.570
<b>but we're rather busy,</b>

09:31.570 --> 09:33.800
<b>so I'll put you out of your
misery right away.</b>

09:34.900 --> 09:36.370
<b>Die!</b>

09:47.080 --> 09:48.620
<b>All too easy!</b>

09:48.620 --> 09:50.480
<b>Is this the infamous Cho Hakkai?!</b>

09:59.130 --> 10:03.200
<b>Commander, it seems Ryokusho
has taken care of Cho Hakkai.</b>

10:03.200 --> 10:04.790
<b>He's now headed towards
Jikoku and Sekieki.</b>

10:06.170 --> 10:07.630
<b>I see.</b>

10:08.240 --> 10:09.700
<b>That leaves only one.</b>

10:10.540 --> 10:12.010
<b>Genjo Sanzo!</b>

10:20.280 --> 10:23.910
<b>Scurrying like a rat! Sekieki,
don't just watch, stop him!</b>

10:24.720 --> 10:26.190
<b>Finally, my turn?!</b>

10:39.130 --> 10:40.600
<b>An explosives specialist now?</b>

10:47.540 --> 10:50.570
<b>Sekieki? He's being too flashy.</b>

10:51.510 --> 10:53.780
<b>Commander, overdoing it
would give rise</b>

10:53.780 --> 10:56.220
<b>to the possibility of damage
by friendly fire, wouldn't it?</b>

10:56.850 --> 10:58.910
<b>You're right. I'll go check things out.</b>

10:59.820 --> 11:02.860
<b>Outo, continue your surveillance,
just to be safe.</b>

11:02.860 --> 11:04.320
<b>Yes, Sir.</b>

11:12.300 --> 11:14.440
<b>Sekieki, hold back!</b>

11:14.440 --> 11:16.460
<b>What're you going to do if you blow
up the Maten Scripture too?!</b>

11:18.070 --> 11:21.100
<b>I'm helping you out because
you're taking too long!</b>

11:23.180 --> 11:24.640
<b>Fighting amongst themselves?</b>

11:27.720 --> 11:29.180
<b>Good!</b>

11:37.830 --> 11:39.290
<b>What?!</b>

11:41.960 --> 11:43.760
<b>What the hell are you aiming at?!</b>

11:44.530 --> 11:46.000
<b>You're not getting away!</b>

11:57.180 --> 11:58.610
<b>Commander!</b>

11:59.710 --> 12:01.750
<b>You seem to be having
quite a hard time.</b>

12:01.750 --> 12:04.220
<b>Just what you might expect
of Genjo Sanzo.</b>

12:04.750 --> 12:07.090
<b>But the futile struggle ends now.</b>

12:07.090 --> 12:09.390
<b>We'll take our time and
slowly corner him.</b>

12:09.390 --> 12:10.860
<b>Yes, Sir.</b>

12:33.780 --> 12:35.440
<b>Damn, it's out of gas?</b>

12:40.720 --> 12:43.160
<b>Here comes a different one.</b>

12:44.460 --> 12:49.290
<b>Well, well, weren't you taught
to be good to nature, monk?</b>

12:50.160 --> 12:54.730
<b>Too bad, but that was once
a part of nature too.</b>

12:57.670 --> 13:00.000
<b>Let's see how long you can
keep up your bluff.</b>

13:01.880 --> 13:05.040
<b>Give it up. You're not getting
away this time.</b>

13:13.450 --> 13:15.180
<b>No escape for him now.</b>

13:15.860 --> 13:17.320
<b>Well, then...</b>

13:20.600 --> 13:22.160
<b>What?!</b>

13:22.160 --> 13:24.470
<b>There's no hope of victory
for you now.</b>

13:24.470 --> 13:27.300
<b>Quietly hand over the Maten Scripture
and surrender yourself.</b>

13:28.470 --> 13:29.940
<b>I refuse.</b>

13:30.840 --> 13:34.040
<b>You want to join your
friends that badly?</b>

13:34.040 --> 13:39.450
<b>Friends? I've never once thought
of that bunch as my friends.</b>

13:41.580 --> 13:45.320
<b>What a smartass! Let's just
kill him already!</b>

13:45.320 --> 13:46.950
<b>Wait!</b>

13:46.950 --> 13:51.030
<b>How about this? We could put in
a good word for you to Homura</b>

13:51.030 --> 13:52.490
<b>and ask him to spare your life.</b>

13:54.130 --> 13:57.400
<b>I have no intention of spending
the rest of my life</b>

13:57.400 --> 13:59.460
<b>as Homura's hound like you guys.</b>

14:00.500 --> 14:04.100
<b>You bastard! Speaking in such a tone
will only shorten your life!</b>

14:05.210 --> 14:08.800
<b>I'm not convinced of that.
After all, I'm still alive.</b>

14:10.610 --> 14:12.600
<b>We'll convince you right away!</b>

14:17.020 --> 14:19.920
<b>You said something about where
my friends were earlier.</b>

14:20.860 --> 14:23.790
<b>Do you guys know where
Goku and the rest are?</b>

14:23.790 --> 14:25.780
<b>You're bluffing with no cards!</b>

14:26.460 --> 14:28.500
<b>If you're willing to go so far,</b>

14:28.500 --> 14:32.800
<b>then we'll send you to the same place,
the world beyond!</b>

14:37.370 --> 14:38.840
<b>What?!</b>

14:40.580 --> 14:41.880
<b>That's...</b>

14:41.880 --> 14:43.240
<b>It can't be!</b>

14:43.240 --> 14:44.650
<b>Son Goku!</b>

14:44.650 --> 14:49.350
<b>Oh, so this is "the world beyond"
you were talking about?</b>

14:49.350 --> 14:51.650
<b>Impossible!</b>

14:53.550 --> 14:55.660
<b>You took long enough,
you stupid monkey.</b>

14:55.660 --> 14:57.090
<b>Sorry!</b>

15:00.660 --> 15:04.970
<b>Damn it, leaving my post is a problem,
but it can't be helped.</b>

15:04.970 --> 15:07.330
<b>It'd be brainless for me to just
continue my surveillance.</b>

15:12.110 --> 15:13.870
<b>Strange...</b>

15:13.870 --> 15:14.640
<b>Could it be...</b>

15:14.640 --> 15:16.140
<b>You sure took long enough
to get here.</b>

15:16.140 --> 15:18.300
<b>I thought I'd die of boredom.</b>

15:19.110 --> 15:20.410
<b>You're Sha Gojyo!</b>

15:20.410 --> 15:22.610
<b>Oh? How very knowledgeable of you.</b>

15:23.180 --> 15:25.350
<b>Your military uniform... A god?</b>

15:26.790 --> 15:28.650
<b>Looks like I won't be bored.</b>

15:31.030 --> 15:33.120
<b>To think I fell for such a simple tactic!</b>

15:34.200 --> 15:37.670
<b>Don't let it bother you.
You hear it a lot,</b>

15:37.670 --> 15:39.960
<b>a tactician getting too involved
to see the bigger picture.</b>

15:41.270 --> 15:44.910
<b>Jikoku may be dead, but
we still outnumber you!</b>

15:44.910 --> 15:45.740
<b>Don't falter!</b>

15:45.740 --> 15:51.010
<b>I'm sorry, but I think that's
no longer the case.</b>

15:51.010 --> 15:53.040
<b>You're... Cho Hakkai!</b>

15:54.120 --> 15:56.150
<b>What is the meaning
of this, Ryokusho?!</b>

15:56.150 --> 15:58.740
<b>Well, I was sure I killed him...</b>

15:59.550 --> 16:01.460
<b>Well, it's always been said</b>

16:01.460 --> 16:04.590
<b>you should play dead if you
meet a bear in the forest.</b>

16:04.590 --> 16:05.930
<b>I guess it really is true.</b>

16:05.930 --> 16:08.330
<b>Damn it, who are you calling a bear?!</b>

16:08.330 --> 16:10.360
<b>You gave off that unnatural scream!</b>

16:10.360 --> 16:11.870
<b>I'm sorry,</b>

16:11.870 --> 16:15.500
<b>but it was much more convenient
for me to be considered dead.</b>

16:16.100 --> 16:18.870
<b>Don't tell me you made us think that</b>

16:18.870 --> 16:22.640
<b>so you could scope out the situation?!</b>

16:22.640 --> 16:26.550
<b>Yes, Hakuryu and I scoped you out.</b>

16:26.550 --> 16:28.780
<b>Assuming there are no hidden reserves,</b>

16:28.780 --> 16:30.650
<b>there's a total of five of you.</b>

16:30.650 --> 16:34.020
<b>Oh, we just killed one,
so that makes it four.</b>

16:34.020 --> 16:36.180
<b>Nope, you're wrong.</b>

16:39.730 --> 16:40.800
<b>Gojyo!</b>

16:40.800 --> 16:44.200
<b>I killed that greenhorn
at the base of the cliff.</b>

16:44.200 --> 16:46.860
<b>So that just leaves the three here.</b>

16:47.840 --> 16:49.300
<b>Outo was killed too?</b>

16:50.910 --> 16:55.670
<b>Oh? So you aren't dead yet,
you stinking monk?</b>

16:56.210 --> 17:00.150
<b>You bastards made me
run all over the place.</b>

17:01.450 --> 17:03.720
<b>Can't run because you
ran out of breath?</b>

17:03.720 --> 17:06.620
<b>That's because you smoke too much!</b>

17:06.620 --> 17:07.990
<b>I'll kill you someday.</b>

17:07.990 --> 17:08.390
<b>I'm so sorry.
I'll kill you someday.</b>

17:08.390 --> 17:09.520
<b>I'm so sorry.
What's with these guys?</b>

17:09.520 --> 17:10.420
<b>I needed a decoy in order to buy
time to scope out the enemy.
What's with these guys?</b>

17:10.420 --> 17:13.360
<b>I needed a decoy in order to buy
time to scope out the enemy.
They've been completely ignoring us.</b>

17:13.360 --> 17:16.300
<b>But it made up for your lack of
exercise, didn't it, Sanzo?</b>

17:16.300 --> 17:17.430
<b>To begin with, it's all his fault!</b>

17:17.430 --> 17:18.930
<b>To begin with, it's all his fault!
Shut up.</b>

17:21.370 --> 17:24.030
<b>I'll kill you for real this time!</b>

17:24.640 --> 17:26.110
<b>Ryokusho!</b>

17:26.470 --> 17:28.640
<b>You don't get it, do you?!</b>

17:28.640 --> 17:31.510
<b>I can't allow myself to be killed</b>

17:31.510 --> 17:33.210
<b>by such a technique!</b>

17:36.650 --> 17:37.750
<b>Ryokusho!</b>

17:37.750 --> 17:41.240
<b>Well, that was technically revenge
for what he did earlier.</b>

17:42.190 --> 17:46.850
<b>Man, and I was going to return the
favor for making me run so much.</b>

17:47.530 --> 17:49.860
<b>Guess all that's left is small fry.</b>

17:49.860 --> 17:52.200
<b>Small fry?! Don't underestimate me!</b>

18:04.040 --> 18:06.410
<b>I hate letting people get away
with making a fool of me.</b>

18:07.520 --> 18:09.280
<b>Sekieki...</b>

18:09.280 --> 18:13.050
<b>Uh-oh, your trusty friends
are all gone now.</b>

18:13.720 --> 18:16.090
<b>It's scary when you make Sanzo mad.</b>

18:17.090 --> 18:19.960
<b>I think it'd be better if you
surrendered quietly.</b>

18:24.470 --> 18:26.330
<b>Genjo Sanzo,</b>

18:26.330 --> 18:30.200
<b>if we had really killed these guys,</b>

18:30.200 --> 18:33.000
<b>would you have accepted
my earlier offer?</b>

18:34.680 --> 18:36.280
<b>No.</b>

18:36.280 --> 18:37.740
<b>You have your answer.</b>

18:38.710 --> 18:40.880
<b>We were ambitious.</b>

18:40.880 --> 18:43.780
<b>Rather than serve under
an incompetent general</b>

18:43.780 --> 18:45.320
<b>in the stupid Heavens,</b>

18:45.320 --> 18:49.520
<b>we thought to follow Homura
and seek our own fortune!</b>

18:49.520 --> 18:51.430
<b>I'll succeed, even alone!</b>

18:51.430 --> 18:54.830
<b>I'll kill you all and take
the Maten Scripture!</b>

18:54.830 --> 18:56.300
<b>Goku!</b>

18:57.230 --> 18:58.700
<b>Leave it to me!</b>

19:07.540 --> 19:09.740
<b>Are you mocking me?!</b>

19:09.740 --> 19:11.230
<b>What're you talking about?</b>

19:12.950 --> 19:14.410
<b>Damn it!</b>

19:16.980 --> 19:18.590
<b>That stupid monkey.</b>

19:18.590 --> 19:20.050
<b>Oh, dear.</b>

19:21.720 --> 19:23.190
<b>It's a game to him.</b>

19:32.330 --> 19:34.340
<b>Why?</b>

19:34.340 --> 19:38.140
<b>Fool, I know when my time
to die has come.</b>

19:39.370 --> 19:41.860
<b>In the Heavens, we had
never known defeat.</b>

19:42.480 --> 19:43.940
<b>So, why...</b>

19:44.910 --> 19:48.470
<b>Tell me one thing. Why did we lose?</b>

19:49.080 --> 19:51.640
<b>What's the secret behind
your strength?</b>

19:55.290 --> 19:57.310
<b>The number of battles we've survived...</b>

19:59.490 --> 20:01.320
<b>The fact that we're alive...</b>

20:04.130 --> 20:05.660
<b>We don't believe.</b>

20:06.500 --> 20:07.970
<b>I see...</b>

20:12.640 --> 20:14.110
<b>This was stupid.</b>

20:17.650 --> 20:20.810
<b>You should've known they
stood no chance.</b>

20:20.810 --> 20:24.520
<b>They'd only have degenerated more
and more through eternity</b>

20:24.520 --> 20:25.990
<b>had they stayed in the Heavens.</b>

20:25.990 --> 20:29.490
<b>I respected their determination
to try and change themselves.</b>

20:29.490 --> 20:32.930
<b>So you gave them a fitting
place to die?</b>

20:34.430 --> 20:36.990
<b>They did magnificently for being
common soldiers.</b>

20:46.570 --> 20:55.380
<b>All people coming and going
carry heavy burdens</b>

20:56.750 --> 21:07.150
<b>Find tomorrow within the mirage
wavering in the distance</b>

21:08.500 --> 21:18.630
<b>Emotions like the sand
spilling out of my hands</b>

21:19.970 --> 21:32.950
<b>The words that pierced my heart
back then suddenly ache</b>

21:32.950 --> 21:44.400
<b>Counting the endless nights,
I search for pieces of me</b>

21:44.400 --> 21:55.680
<b>The more I lose, the more certain
this feeling becomes</b>

21:55.680 --> 22:07.850
<b>Now, I can surely walk
on and on forever</b>
